21	// common core; the Command Processor is the sole memory engine. Host memory
22	// is the command ring + DMA staging, reachable by the CP's m_axi_host master
23	// (a host-only XRT BO on hardware; plain process memory under xrtsim, where
24	// the sim runs in-process and the m_axi_host model dereferences it directly).
