73	// The AXI-Lite demux in VX_afu_wrap routes host addresses 0x1000..0x1FFF
74	// to the CP regfile (mapped to CP's native 0x000-based 12-bit address
75	// space). Callers pass the CP-internal offset; cp_reg_* add this base.
